        "*": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><table class=\"infobox darktable\" cellspacing=\"3\" style=\"border-spacing:3px;width:22em;width:21.5em;\"><tbody><tr class=\"above-header\"><th colspan=\"2\" style=\"text-align:center;font-size:125%;font-weight:bold;padding:5px;\"><span style=\"display:table;width:100%;border-collapse:collapse;border-spacing:0;\"><span style=\"display:table-row;\"><span style=\"display:table-cell;vertical-align:middle;padding-right:5px;width:1px;\"><span class=\"\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Faction\" title=\"Neutral\"><img alt=\"Neutral\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/wowpedia/images/1/19/Neutral_32.png/revision/latest?cb=20110620212507\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"18\" height=\"32\" class=\"mw-file-element\" data-image-name=\"Neutral 32.png\" data-image-key=\"Neutral_32.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" /></a></span></span></span><span style=\"display:table-cell;vertical-align:middle;padding-right:2px;\">Lieutenant Walden</span></span></span></th></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\" style=\"text-align:center;\">\n<span typeof=\"mw:File/Frameless\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/wowpedia/images/7/7f/Lieutenant_Walden.jpg/revision/latest?cb=20151102151809\" class=\"mw-file-description image\" title=\"Image of Lieutenant Walden\"><img alt=\"Image of Lieutenant Walden\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/wowpedia/images/7/7f/Lieutenant_Walden.jpg/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/200?cb=20151102151809\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"200\" height=\"176\" class=\"mw-file-element\" data-image-name=\"Lieutenant Walden.jpg\" data-image-key=\"Lieutenant_Walden.jpg\" data-relevant=\"1\" /></a></span></td></tr><tr><th scope=\"row\" style=\"text-align:left;background-color:transparent;\">Gender</th><td>\nMale</td></tr><tr><th scope=\"row\" style=\"text-align:left;background-color:transparent;\">Race</th><td>\n<a href=\"/wiki/Human\" title=\"Human\">Human</a>&#160;(Humanoid)</td></tr><tr><th scope=\"row\" style=\"text-align:left;background-color:transparent;\">Level</th><td>\n3</td></tr><tr><th scope=\"row\" style=\"text-align:left;background-color:transparent;\">Reaction</th><td>\n<a href=\"/wiki/Friendly\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Friendly\"><span class=\"rep-friendly\" title=\"Friendly\">Friendly</span></a></td></tr><tr><th scope=\"row\" style=\"text-align:left;background-color:transparent;\">Affiliation(s)</th><td>\n<a href=\"/wiki/Gilneas_(faction)\" title=\"Gilneas (faction)\">Gilneas</a></td></tr><tr><th scope=\"row\" style=\"text-align:left;background-color:transparent;\">Occupation</th><td>\n<a href=\"/wiki/Lieutenant\" title=\"Lieutenant\">Lieutenant</a></td></tr><tr><th scope=\"row\" style=\"text-align:left;background-color:transparent;\">Location</th><td>\n<a href=\"/wiki/Merchant_Square\" title=\"Merchant Square\">Merchant Square</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Gilneas_City_(starting_zone)\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Gilneas City (starting zone)\">Gilneas City</a></td></tr><tr><th scope=\"row\" style=\"text-align:left;background-color:transparent;\">Status</th><td>\nDeceased</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<p><b>Lieutenant Walden</b> is a <a href=\"/wiki/Human\" title=\"Human\">human</a> <a href=\"/wiki/Quest_giver\" title=\"Quest giver\">quest giver</a> located in <a href=\"/wiki/Merchant_Square\" title=\"Merchant Square\">Merchant Square</a> in the <a href=\"/wiki/Worgen\" title=\"Worgen\">worgen</a> starting zone of <a href=\"/wiki/Gilneas_City_(starting_zone)\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Gilneas City (starting zone)\">Gilneas City</a>. He was under <a href=\"/wiki/Liam_Greymane\" title=\"Liam Greymane\">Liam Greymane</a>'s command to help evacuate the city, but was killed by <a href=\"/wiki/Worgen\" title=\"Worgen\">worgen</a> during their invasion of Gilneas.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Speculation\">Speculation</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table style=\"background: transparent;\">\n\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/wowpedia/images/2/2b/Questionmark-medium.png/revision/latest?cb=20061019212216\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"Questionmark-medium\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/wowpedia/images/2/2b/Questionmark-medium.png/revision/latest?cb=20061019212216\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"41\" height=\"55\" class=\"mw-file-element\" data-image-name=\"Questionmark-medium.png\" data-image-key=\"Questionmark-medium.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" /></a></span>\n</td>\n<td valign=\"top\"><div style=\"border-top: 1px solid #808080; border-bottom: 1px solid #808080; padding: 1ex 1em; margin-top: 0.3ex; max-width: 34em;\"><small style=\"line-height: 120%;\">This article or section includes speculation, observations or opinions possibly supported by lore or by Blizzard officials. <b>It should not be taken as representing official lore.</b></small></div>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<ul><li>He might have been a member of the <a href=\"/wiki/Gilnean_Royal_Guard\" title=\"Gilnean Royal Guard\">Gilnean Royal Guard</a>, as Liam sends the adventurer off to him for evacuation.</li>\n<li>He may be related to <a href=\"/wiki/Lord_Walden\" title=\"Lord Walden\">Lord Walden</a>.</li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Patch_changes\">Patch changes</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li><span style=\"display:inline-block; min-width: 50px; text-align:center\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/World_of_Warcraft:_Cataclysm\" title=\"Cataclysm\"><img alt=\"Cataclysm\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"39\" height=\"15\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Cata-Logo-Small.png\" data-image-key=\"Cata-Logo-Small.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/wowpedia/images/e/ef/Cata-Logo-Small.png/revision/latest?cb=20120818171714\" /></a></span></span> <b><a href=\"/wiki/Patch_4.0.3a\" title=\"Patch 4.0.3a\">Patch 4.0.3a</a> (2010-11-23):</b> Added.   <i></i><br /></li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"External_links\">External links</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul class=\"elinks\">\n<li class=\"wowhead\"><a target=\"_self\" rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://www.wowhead.com/npc=34863\">Wowhead</a></li>\n<li class=\"sigrie\"><a target=\"_self\" rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://www.wowdb.com/npcs/34863\">WoWDB</a></li>\n\n</ul>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261109160712\nCache expiry: 2592000\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.083 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.115 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 1473/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 7971/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 542/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 10/100\nExpensive parser function count: 1/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 0/5000000 bytes\nLua time usage: 0.008/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 646046/104857600 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   66.011      1 -total\n 78.33%   51.708      1 Template:Npcbox\n 70.80%   46.733      1 Template:Infobox\n 21.87%   14.435      1 Template:Level\n  9.99%    6.592      1 Template:Patch_4.0.3a\n  7.08%    4.676      1 Template:Elinks-NPC\n  6.48%    4.279      1 Template:Patch\n  4.53%    2.987      1 Template:Rep\n  4.36%    2.878      1 Template:FactionIcon\n  4.29%    2.831      1 T